    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional Town Centre Property with Versatile PotentialA wonderful opportunity to acquire a substantial three-storey traditional townhouse in a prime town centre location, extending to nine bedrooms and within easy walking distance of a wide range of amenities, including shops, retail units, gyms, medical facilities, pharmacies and restaurants.This is a rare opportunity to acquire a High Street property with valuable side vehicular access, providing excellent convenience and further potential.The property offers considerable flexibility and would suit a variety of uses, subject to the necessary planning permissions. Potential uses include a private residence, retirement home, investment property or commercial accommodation, such as offices, a medical surgery, treatment centre or conversion to apartments subject to planning permission.The property comprises a three-storey residential building of traditional block construction, incorporating a pitched slate roof. The property enjoys approximately 9 metres of frontage to High Street. The property also enjoys pedestrian access to the side from Bowers Lane.The overall property extends to approximately 233 sq. m./ 2,508 sq. ft., offering a substantial footprint in a highly accessible town centre location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround floor: - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.16 x 5.27\n\n\nSittingroom - 5.46 x 4.9\n\n\nBedroom One - 2.5 x 4.18\n\n\nInner Hall - 1.8 x 2\n\n\nKitchen/Diningroom - 7.65 x 4.66 + 1.7 x 1.93\n\n\nToilet - 1.13 x 1\n\n\nFirst floor: - \n\n\nLanding - 7 x 1\n\n\nBedroom Two - 3.42 x 4\n\n\nShower room - 2.97 x 1.82\n\n\nBedroom Three - 3.4 x 3.83\n\n\nBedroom Four - 3.2 x 5\n\n\nSecond floor: - \n\n\nLanding - 7 x 1\n\n\nBedroom Five - 3.66 x 2.88\n\n\nBedroom Six - 3.38 x 2.27\n\n\nBedroom Seven - 3.34 x 3\n\n\nBedroom Eight - 2.9 x 3.17\nToilet and wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Nine - 3.1 x 3.78\n\n\nHouse area: 233 sq.m., (2,508 sq.ft.) - \n\n\nStore - 5.3 x 2.28\n\n\nBoiler House - \n\n\nRear Yard Area - \nAccessible from Bowers Lane with potential for off street car parking\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Prime town centre / High Street location</li><li>Substantial three-storey townhouse</li><li>Nine bedrooms</li><li>Oil fired radiator central heating</li><li>Approx. 9m High Street frontage</li><li>Approx. 19m site depth</li><li>Rear vehicular access via Bowers Lane</li><li>Gross site area of approx. 202.5 sq. m./2,108 sq. ft./ 0.46 acre</li><li>Excellent proximity to retail, leisure, medical and hospitality amenities</li><li>Zoned Town Centre facilities; Suitable for a range of potential uses, subject to planning permission</li><li>Rare opportunity with significant residential and commercial potential</ul>"
      },
